    <statement><p>Find the derivative of the function <m>f(x)</m>, below.  It may be to your
advantage to simplify  first.</p>
<p><m>\displaystyle f(x) = (x^3 - \root 8\of{x}) 6^x</m></p>
<p><m>f'(x) =</m> <fillin characters="55" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(3x^{3-1}-\frac{1}{8}x^{-1+\frac{1}{8}}\right)\cdot 6^{x}+\left(x^{3}-x^{\frac{1}{8}}\right)\ln\mathopen{}\left(6\right)\cdot 6^{x}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><p><me>f'(x) = 
  (3 x^{2} - \frac{1}{8} x^{-7/8}) 6^x + (x^3 - \root 8\of{x}) \ln(6) 6^x</me></p>
</solution>
